  "sourceQuote": "직각삼각형 $\\text{DCE}$에서 $\\overline{\\text{CE}}=3$, $\\angle\\text{CDE}=30^\\circ$이므로 $$\\overline{\\text{DC}} = \\frac{3}{\\tan 30^\\circ} = 3\\sqrt{3}, \\quad \\overline{\\text{DE}} = \\frac{",
  "sourceConditions": [
    {
      "id": "q06_solution",
      "condition": "직각삼각형 $\\text{DCE}$에서 $\\overline{\\text{CE}}=3$, $\\angle\\text{CDE}=30^\\circ$이므로 $$\\overline{\\text{DC}} = \\frac{3}{\\tan 30^\\circ} = 3\\sqrt{3}, \\quad \\overline{\\text{DE}} = \\frac{3}{\\sin 30^\\circ} = 6$$ $\\triangle\\text{BDE}$에서 외각 $\\angle\\text{CDE}=30^\\circ = 15^\\circ + \\angle\\text{BED}$이므로 $\\angle\\text{BED}=15^\\circ = \\angle\\text{DBE}$이고, 따라서 $\\overline{\\text{BD}}=\\overline{\\text{DE}}=6$이다. 그러므로 $\\overline{\\text{BC}} = 6 + 3\\sqrt{3}$이고 $$\\tan 15^\\circ = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{CE}}}{\\overline{\\text{BC}}} = \\frac{3}{6 + 3\\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{1}{2+\\sqrt{3}} = 2 - \\sqrt{3}$$ 따라서 정답은 ②이다.",
      "mappedTo": "mathPlan.nodes"
    }
  ],
  "caption": "해설 관계: DE=BD=6, DC=3√3에서 tan15°=3/(6+3√3)",
